13	// ChatGPT-only to Claude + ChatGPT. The capability was never absent. It was
14	// absent FROM ONE WORKER'S VIEW, and the worker treated that as the same thing.
15	//
16	// So the defect is not missing doctrine. It is doctrine with no enforcement
17	// surface — the same failure shape as publication authority before it was
18	// wired, and as every "rule that is only a model" this substrate has found.
19	//
20	// THE RULE: a worker may not decide for itself that it has exhausted its
21	// options. Concession requires evidence, and incomplete evidence means keep
22	// searching.
